 /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Athletics 0 \u2022 Brawl 7 (Claws) \u2022 Drive 3 (Dropships) \u2022 Firearms 6 (Plasma)\u2022 Larceny 0 \u2022 Stealth 4 \u2022 Survival 4 \u2022 Weaponry 0</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Animal Ken 3 (Moas) \u2022 Empathy 5 \u2022 Expression 0 \u2022 Intimidate 0 \u2022 Persuasion 5 \u2022 Socialize 2 \u2022 Streetwise 1 \u2022 Subterfuge 0</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><u><b>Merits</b></u></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Good Time Management 1</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Crack Driver 3</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Trained Observer 3 </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Totem 5 </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Efficient Killer 3 </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Defensive Combat 1 </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Fire Fight 3 </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Staff 5 </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Contacts (Genelabs) 3 </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Contacts (Robotics Company) 3 </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><u><b>Gifts &amp; Rites</b></u></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Affinity Gifts: Knowledge, Shaping, Technology/SIZE]</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">New Moon</span></span